## Example settings.json
Copied to `%LocalAppData%\AkkeohsSubtitlesForVegas\settings.json` (user-writable).

```json
{
  "AkkeohsCliPath": "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\AkkeohsSubtitlesForVegas\\bin\\whisper-cli.exe",
  "FfmpegPath": "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\AkkeohsSubtitlesForVegas\\bin\\ffmpeg.exe",
  "ModelsDirectory": "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\AkkeohsSubtitlesForVegas\\models",
  "ModelFileName": "ggml-base.bin",
  "Language": "auto",
  "Threads": 4,
  "TranslateToEnglish": false,
  "MaxSegmentChars": 42,
  "TrackName": "Akkeoh Subtitles",
  "TextGeneratorName": "Sony Titles & Text",
  "FontFamily": "Arial",
  "FontSize": 14,
  "PanCropPlacement": "Lower Third",
  "TimingOffsetMs": 0
}
```

`PanCropPlacement` options: Default, Lower Third, Bottom Center, Bottom Left, Bottom Right, Top Center, Top Left, Top Right, Center.
